    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>See the World Differently.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Possessions</i>, perspective changes everything. Solve mesmerizing puzzles by shifting your view and bending reality to your will. Explore a minimalist 3D world filled with illusionary surprises, and uncover a quiet story of connection and family as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Beautiful, Calming Escape.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles:</strong> Use perspective to align objects and solve intricate challenges that test your creativity and spatial thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story Without Words:</strong> Discover a subtle, emotional narrative through visual storytelling\u2014no dialogue, just meaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Worlds:</strong> Explore vibrant, minimalist 3D environments that twist and transform based on how you view them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax and Reflect:</strong> A calming soundtrack complements the meditative gameplay, offering a serene escape from the everyday.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Possessions</i> invite you to slow down, reflect, and see the extraordinary in the everyday.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>See the World Differently.\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Possessions</i>, perspective changes everything. Solve mesmerizing puzzles by shifting your view and bending reality to your will. Explore a minimalist 3D world filled with illusionary surprises, and uncover a quiet story of connection and family as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Beautiful, Calming Escape.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles:</strong> Use perspective to align objects and solve intricate challenges that test your creativity and spatial thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story Without Words:</strong> Discover a subtle, emotional narrative through visual storytelling\u2014no dialogue, just meaning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Worlds:</strong> Explore vibrant, minimalist 3D environments that twist and transform based on how you view them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax and Reflect:</strong> A calming soundtrack complements the meditative gameplay, offering a serene escape from the everyday.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Possessions</i> invite you to slow down, reflect, and see the extraordinary in the everyday.</p>",
    "short_description": "What if the solution isn\u2019t what you see, but how you see it? In Possessions, perspective is the key to solving mind-bending puzzles. Rotate objects, shift your view, and uncover a story told through a beautifully minimalist 3D world.",
